OL,3,GNEWSAEx councillor jailed for rape and
OL,4,Aassault of woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Worcester councillor has been
OL,7,Fjailed after a jury found him guilty of
OL,8,Fraping and assaulting a woman.
OL,10,FShawaz Ditta, 31, denied the charges
OL,11,Fbut was convicted of one count of rape
OL,12,Fand two counts of assault which
OL,13,Finvolved weapons.
OL,15,FThe Conservative was elected to
OL,16,FWorcester City Council in May 2022,
OL,17,Fwith the offences taking place during
OL,18,Fhis time in office.
OL,20,FA judge handed him a nine year jail
OL,21,Fsentence at Worcester Crown Court on
OL,22,FThursday.
